<title>BRAZIL: Brazil operating deficit in March 3.61 pct GDP.</title>
<headline>Brazil operating deficit in March 3.61 pct GDP.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's consolidated public sector operational deficit in March was 29.375 billion reais, equivalent to 3.61 percent of gross domestic product, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that the net public sector operational deficit was 3.46 percent of GDP in February.</p>
